  {
   "id": 242541,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Describe how a researcher could determine the population size and density of a bird population on one of the Hawaiian islands.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 759625,
     "content_html": "Population size can be determined by life tables. The area of the island in square kilometers is divided by the population size to determine the density of the bird population."
    },
    {
     "id": 759626,
     "content_html": "Population size can be determined by the mark and recapture method. The population size is divided by the area of the island in square kilometers to determine the density of the bird population."
    },
